# Commit after every fix or feature

After completing a bug fix or shipping a feature (including UI polish), create a git commit before ending the turn.

Follow the repo commit protocol:
- Run `git status`, `git diff`, and `git log` in parallel first
- Stage only relevant files (never `.env` or secrets)
- Use a concise HEREDOC commit message focused on why
- Do not push unless explicitly asked
- Do not amend unless the standard amend conditions are met
